  "question": "设 $f(x) = (x^{6} + 2x^{5} - 10x^{4} - 12x^{3} + 18x^{2} + 30x - 210)^{2023}$ ，求 $f\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{45} - 1}{2}\\right)$ .",
  "answer": "$t^2 + t = 11$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "函数复合",
    "函数方程"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 直接计算函数值很困难，若令 $t = \\frac{\\sqrt{45} - 1}{2}$ ，则有 $t^2 + t = 11$ ，只需将 $f(t)$ 的表达式拼凑成以 $t^2 + t$ 为变量的形式即可."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "记 $t = \\frac{\\sqrt{45} - 1}{2}$ ，则 $(2t + 1)^2 = 45$ ，从而知 $t^2 + t = 11$ ，于是"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\begin{array}{r l} & t ^ {6} + 2 t ^ {5} - 1 0 t ^ {4} - 1 2 t ^ {3} + 1 8 t ^ {2} + 3 0 t - 2 1 0 \\\\ & \\quad = (t ^ {6} + t ^ {5}) + (t ^ {5} + t ^ {4}) - (1 1 t ^ {4} + 1 1 t ^ {3}) - (t ^ {3} + t ^ {2}) + (1 9 t ^ {2} + 1 9 t) + 1 1 t - 2 1 0 \\\\ & \\quad = (t ^ {2} + t) (t ^ {4} + t ^ {3} - 1 1 t ^ {2} - t + 1 9) + 1 1 t - 2 1 0 \\\\ & \\quad = 1 1 [ (t ^ {2} + t) t ^ {2} - 1 1 t ^ {2} - t + 1 9 ] + 1 1 t - 2 1 0 \\\\ & \\quad = 1 1 (1 9 - t) + 1 1 t - 2 1 0 = 1 1 \\times 1 9 - 2 1 0 \\\\ & \\quad = - 1. \\end{array}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "从而"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "f \\left(\\frac {\\sqrt {4 5 - 1}}{2}\\right) = f (t) = \\left(t ^ {6} + 2 t ^ {5} - 1 0 t ^ {4} - 1 2 t ^ {3} + 1 8 t ^ {2} + 3 0 t - 2 1 0\\right) ^ {2 0 2 3} = (- 1) ^ {2 0 2 3} = - 1."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$t^2 + t = 11$",
    "techniques_used": [
      "函数复合",
      "函数方程"
    ]
  },
